            "review_title": "Review at Hue Delights",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n27\nCentral Vietnamese Cuisine in Saigon\nOct 2023 • Solo\nA lovely lunch full of central Vietnamese flavours. I came here by myself and ordered 3 dishes including a rice dish authentic to the Hue region.\n\nI found everything tasty, as it was a late lunch there were only a few other diners and the service was super quick and friendly. I would eat here again but next time with a group of friends so that we can order more.\nRead more\nWritten October 23, 2023",
